  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a large saucepan with boiling water.\n• Cook udon noodles over medium-high heat, gently stirring with a fork to separate, until tender, 1-2 minutes.\n• Drain, rinse and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6886ef42b6ffa7a20c3b9a09/step-46122900.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice carrot into half-moons.\n• Roughly chop Asian greens.\n• Thinly slice flat mushrooms (see ingredients) and long chilli (if using).\n• Finely chop garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6886ef42b6ffa7a20c3b9a09/step-59cb7d10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Using your hands, crumble firm tofu (see ingredients) into 1cm chunks.\n• In a medium bowl, combine tofu, Asian BBQ seasoning and a drizzle of olive oil.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6886ef42b6ffa7a20c3b9a09/step-436c6920.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• When oil is hot, cook tofu, turning occasionally, until golden, 5-7 minutes.\n• Remove pan from heat, then stir in half the soy sauce mix and a splash of water, until tofu is well coated.\n• Transfer to a bowl and cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6886ef42b6ffa7a20c3b9a09/step-b33a2e30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Wipe out frying pan and return to high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook mushrooms, until just softened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add carrot and cook until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Reduce heat to medium, then add Asian greens and garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add cooked udon noodles, hoisin sauce, remaining soy sauce mix, the vinegar and a good splash of water, tossing to combine. Season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6886ef42b6ffa7a20c3b9a09/step-a00cbc40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide mushroom udon noodles between bowls.\n• Top with Chinese BBQ crumbled tofu.\n• Garnish with chilli to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6886ef42b6ffa7a20c3b9a09/step-bea8c950.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
